# Payment
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Payments — a confirmed payment, matched to an Invoice automatically where
# possible, queued for manual reconciliation where not
# Case 8 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: payment-invoice.menata, payment-webhook-event.menata

Payment

Fields

- Webhook Event : Payment Webhook Event
- Invoice : Invoice
- Amount : Money
- Paid At : Date
- Match Status : Matched | Unmatched

Events

When Reconcile

    Invoice set

    Invoice Amount Paid plus Amount

    if Invoice Amount Paid is greater than or equal to Invoice Amount Due

        Invoice Status Paid

    Match Status Matched

Constraints

- Webhook Event is required.
- Amount is required.

Permissions

Finance

- Reconcile

Views

- Payment List : List
- Unmatched Payments : List
- Payment Detail : Detail
